  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tsgtg1rrsd_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><a href=\"https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/user-javascript-and-css/nbhcbdghjpllgmfilhnhkllmkecfmpld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/user-javascript-and-css/nbhcbdghjpllgmfilhnhkllmkecfmpld</a> 在油猴之外，居然也有 10 万用户级别的类似功能插件。</div>\n<div>杉木哥慧眼识珠。 我大概介绍一下玩法，去各种地方找到真实问题，然后让AI回答，生成结果页面，然后把结果页面再聚合成不同的tag页面，把tag页面和问题结果页面都提交给搜索引擎收录。</div>\n<div>注意，不限于IT类问题，各行各业都可以做。</div>\n<div>一个收录全球各大城市初创公司列表网站 <a href=\"https://startups-list.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://startups-list.com/</a> 香港 <a href=\"https://hong-kong.startups-list.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://hong-kong.startups-list.com/</a> 伦敦 <a href=\"https://london.startups-list.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://london.startups-list.com/</a> 东京 <a href=\"https://tokyo.startups-list.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://tokyo.startups-list.com/</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tsgtg1rrsd_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tsgtg1rrsd_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tsgtg1rrsd_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
